---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="The Difference Starts Underground"
  description="Filthy Rich Soil Co. provides whole-property regenerative land stewardship for estates in Chester County, PA. Soil-first, chemical-free, one-year agreements — every property documented from the first visit."
  transparentNav={true}
>

<style is:global>
  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    position: relative; height: 100vh; min-height: 600px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;
    background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1663185777390-d44a6f4724b9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center center / cover no-repeat;
    background-attachment: fixed;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.3) 0%, rgba(1,50,32,0.6) 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 100%);
  }
  .hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 0 5%; max-width: 900px; }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 900; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .hero p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 40px;
  }
  .hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .scroll-hint {
    position: absolute; bottom: 32px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; opacity: 0.5;
    animation: scrollBounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .scroll-hint span { font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: white; }
  .scroll-hint svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; color: white; }
  @keyframes scrollBounce { 0%,100%{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)} 50%{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(8px)} }

  /* ── QUOTE STRIP ── */
  .quote-strip {
    position: relative;
    background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590167168350-c4c1170eadf9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center 30% / cover no-repeat;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    padding: 120px 5%; text-align: center;
  }
  .quote-strip::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: var(--overlay-forest);
  }
  .quote-strip-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .quote-strip blockquote {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-style: italic; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .quote-strip cite {
    font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold-lite); font-style: normal;
  }

  /* ── SERVICES ── */
  .services-section {
    position: relative;
    background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1776014692099-cfe4eb36487e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center 60% / cover no-repeat;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    padding: 120px 5%;
  }
  .services-section::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,8,3,0.82) 0%, rgba(1,50,32,0.75) 100%);
  }
  .services-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
  .service-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 36px 32px;
    transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .service-card::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), transparent);
    opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }
  .service-card:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
  .service-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .service-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 20px; display: block; }
  .service-card h3 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-style: italic;
    color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .service-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.68); line-height: 1.75; }

  /* ── SPLIT SECTION ── */
  .split-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; min-height: 600px; }
  .split-img {
    background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617576683096-00fc8eecb3af?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80') center center / cover no-repeat;
    min-height: 400px;
  }
  .split-content {
    background: var(--forest); padding: 100px 60px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
  }
  .split-content .section-eyebrow { color: var(--gold-lite); }
  .split-content .section-title { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .split-content p { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .diff-list { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .diff-list li {
    font-size: 0.9rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); padding: 8px 0;
    padding-left: 22px; position: relative; line-height: 1.5; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .diff-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .diff-list li::before { content: '→'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }

  /* ── SOIL SCIENCE STRIP ── */
  .science-strip {
    position: relative;
    background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1712541151407-1672a80e8d19?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center center / cover no-repeat;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    padding: 140px 5%;
  }
  .science-strip::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.82) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 60%, transparent 100%);
  }
  .science-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 580px; }
  .science-inner .section-eyebrow { color: var(--gold-lite); }
  .science-inner .section-title { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .science-inner p { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .stats-row { display: flex; gap: 48px; margin-top: 48px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--gold-lite); line-height: 1; display: block;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); margin-top: 6px; display: block;
  }

  /* ── CREATIONS MOSAIC ── */
  .creations-section { background: #050a05; padding: 100px 5%; }
  .creations-header { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 60px;
    display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; }
  .creations-header-text { flex: 1; }
  .view-all-link {
    font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: var(--gold-lite); text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .view-all-link:hover { color: var(--gold); }
  .mosaic {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    gap: 12px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .mosaic-item { border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; cursor: pointer; }
  .mosaic-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.5s; }
  .mosaic-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); }
  .mosaic-item-overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.7) 100%);
    opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;
    display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding: 20px;
  }
  .mosaic-item:hover .mosaic-item-overlay { opacity: 1; }
  .mosaic-item-overlay span {
    font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  }
  .mosaic-item:nth-child(1) { grid-column: span 5; grid-row: span 2; height: 460px; }
  .mosaic-item:nth-child(2) { grid-column: span 4; height: 220px; }
  .mosaic-item:nth-child(3) { grid-column: span 3; height: 220px; }
  .mosaic-item:nth-child(4) { grid-column: span 4; height: 228px; }
  .mosaic-item:nth-child(5) { grid-column: span 3; height: 228px; }
  .mosaic-item:nth-child(6) { grid-column: span 4; height: 260px; }
  .mosaic-item:nth-child(7) { grid-column: span 8; height: 260px; }

  /* ── TESTIMONIAL ── */
  .testimonial-strip {
    position: relative;
    background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500651230702-0e2d8a49d4e6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center 40% / cover no-repeat;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    padding: 140px 5%; text-align: center;
  }
  .testimonial-strip::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,5,2,0.75); }
  .testimonial-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .stars { color: var(--gold-lite); font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: 4px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .testimonial-inner blockquote {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    font-style: italic; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .testimonial-inner cite {
    font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-style: normal;
  }

  /* ── CTA ── */
  .cta-section {
    position: relative;
    background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1416879595882-3373a0480b5b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center 70% / cover no-repeat;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    padding: 160px 5%; text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-section::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, rgba(1,50,32,0.85) 100%);
  }
  .cta-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-inner .section-eyebrow { color: var(--gold-lite); }
  .cta-inner h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 900; font-style: italic;
    color: var(--white); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .cta-inner p { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 40px; }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .split-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .split-img { height: 320px; }
    .split-content { padding: 60px 30px; }
    .mosaic { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .mosaic-item:nth-child(1) { grid-column: span 2; height: 280px; }
    .mosaic-item:nth-child(2),
    .mosaic-item:nth-child(3),
    .mosaic-item:nth-child(4),
    .mosaic-item:nth-child(5) { grid-column: span 1; height: 180px; }
    .mosaic-item:nth-child(6) { grid-column: span 2; height: 200px; }
    .mosaic-item:nth-child(7) { grid-column: span 2; height: 200px; }
    .creations-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero { background-attachment: scroll; }
    .quote-strip { background-attachment: scroll; }
    .services-section { background-attachment: scroll; }
    .science-strip { background-attachment: scroll; }
    .testimonial-strip { background-attachment: scroll; }
    .cta-section { background-attachment: scroll; }
    .stats-row { gap: 28px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-btns { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    .hero-btns .btn-primary, .hero-btns .btn-ghost { width: 100%; max-width: 300px; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">Estate Land Stewardship · Chester County, PA</span>
    <h1>The Difference<br>Starts Underground.</h1>
    <p>Complete property stewardship for Chester County estates. Soil-first, low input, beautiful design and maintenance.</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Request a Walkthrough</a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn-ghost">Our Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">
    <span>Scroll</span>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7"/></svg>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PARALLAX QUOTE -->
<div class="quote-strip reveal">
  <div class="quote-strip-inner">
    <blockquote>From the soil up. The whole property, year after year.</blockquote>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section class="services-section" id="services">
  <div class="services-inner">
    <span class="section-eyebrow reveal">What We Do</span>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-d1">Stewardship, Not Maintenance</h2>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <span class="service-icon">🔬</span>
        <h3>Soil &amp; Site Assessment</h3>
        <p>Where every property starts. Multi-point sampling, a full lab panel, and a written account of what's actually happening in your ground — and why. A diagnosis and a solution, not another perpetual problem.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card reveal reveal-d1">
        <span class="service-icon">🌿</span>
        <h3>Estate Stewardship</h3>
        <p>The whole property under one program, on a one-year agreement. Soil, beds, turf, edges, water, woodland — managed as one system by the same people every visit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card reveal reveal-d2">
        <span class="service-icon">✂️</span>
        <h3>Pruning &amp; Specimen Care</h3>
        <p>The part of this trade that takes years to learn to see correctly. Structural pruning and specimen care done for the long life of the plant — cuts that build strength and form over decades instead of forcing a shape that has to be repeated every season.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card reveal reveal-d3">
        <span class="service-icon">🌾</span>
        <h3>Native Planting &amp; Meadow</h3>
        <p>Species chosen for this region's soil, rainfall, and pollinators. Bed design, woodland edge, turf-to-meadow conversion — plantings that need less from us every year, not more.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SPLIT: THE DIFFERENCE -->
<section class="split-section">
  <div class="split-img"></div>
  <div class="split-content">
    <span class="section-eyebrow reveal">Our Difference</span>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-d1">A trade worth doing properly</h2>
    <p class="reveal">Nothing on a property goes wrong for no reason. Weeds, bare patches, plants that sulk for three years — each one is pointing at a cause. Permaculture has a phrase for this: the problem is the solution. So we fix causes, not symptoms. It's slower in year one and cheaper every year after, and it's why we spend on training rather than on chemicals.</p>
    <p class="reveal">Nature is already doing most of this work. Soil biology feeds plants, deep roots move water, diverse plantings hold their own ground. Our job is to set those processes up correctly and then stay out of their way — working with what the land is trying to do rather than fighting it every season.</p>
    <ul class="diff-list reveal reveal-d1">
      <li>Organic inputs only — no synthetic programs, ever</li>
      <li>Native species selected to thrive</li>
      <li>A small crew you'll know by name — the same people every visit</li>
      <li>Programs designed to need less from us each year</li>
      <li>Outcomes tracked — not just tasks completed</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Request a Walkthrough</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BEAUTY STRIP -->
<section class="science-strip">
  <div class="science-inner">
    <span class="section-eyebrow reveal">Designed to Thrive. Built to Impress.</span>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-d1">Ecological and beautiful are not a trade-off — they're a skill.</h2>
    <p class="reveal reveal-d2">Selecting the right plants for your soil, light, and season. Placing them so they support each other and reward you with color, texture, and fragrance across every month of the year. Knowing what to cut, what to leave, and when — so the property still reads as cared for in November. That's the craft. The result just looks effortless.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT YOU'LL SEE HERE -->
<section class="creations-section">
  <div class="services-inner" style="max-width:860px;">
    <span class="section-eyebrow reveal">Our Work</span>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-d1" style="margin-bottom:28px">We launch in spring 2027. This page will fill with real properties.</h2>
    <p class="reveal reveal-d1" style="font-size:1rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72);line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:32px;">We're a new company doing established work. Rather than describe results we haven't produced yet, we'd rather show you the properties as they change — and be straightforward about how long real change actually takes.</p>
    <ul class="diff-list reveal reveal-d2">
      <li>Soil tested at baseline and again at twelve months</li>
      <li>Progress measured against where a property started, not against a brochure</li>
      <li>The results that take longer than we expected, reported the same as the ones that don't</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/creations" class="btn-primary reveal reveal-d2">See the Work We Do</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="cta-inner">
    <span class="section-eyebrow reveal">Get Started</span>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-d1">Start with a walk around your property.</h2>
    <p class="reveal reveal-d2">No charge, no report. We walk your land with you, listen to what you want it to become, and start shaping a plan to get there over the long term. If it's a fit, the next step is a full soil and site assessment.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary reveal reveal-d2">Request a Walkthrough →</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>
